== 3. GUARD FIELD vs BODY FIELD, with the partition the body induces ==
  The new predicate reads d->warned_unimpl (bit relative_addr >> 2).  The guarded body reads writeflag, relative_addr,
  len, idata (write) / odata (read), and writes d->warned_unimpl.  Writers of warned_unimpl: this arm and DEVINIT's
  memset ONLY (grep) -- so no state where guard field and body field disagree can be built except across device
  instances (one instance per process: NOT CLAIMED).
  Partitions the body induces: writeflag {READ, WRITE} (the `if (writeflag == MEM_WRITE)`); the latch bit {clear, set};
  the dispatch LABEL (26 exact cases) -- the label's value flows into the latch index, so labels are a floor axis.
  Floor cells: 26 labels x {read, write} x {clear, set} = 104.  Covered by TWO free-running sessions: `p2 ann rd`
  (every label READ first [read, clear] then WRITTEN [write, set]) and `p2 ann wr` (every label WRITTEN first
  [write, clear] then READ [read, set]) -- 104 of 104.  len is NOT tested by the body (only printed): its values are
  clause-(e) disclosure, SAMPLED at 1, 2, 4, 8 by the non-word first-access rows.

== 4. CHANNEL (planned row -> the mutant it is aimed at -> the observable that differs) ==
  unasm / live / neg apparatus / vbr reset / free ctl / free quiet  -> apparatus / device presence / free-running proof
  cased census   -> a cased label dropped                -> that load FAULTs: PC + sentinels left
  t1cmp rt, tctl rt, vbr rt, t1count inc, cased wr  -> a cased WRITE path broken -> read-back value / PC
  p2 rd census   -> a population-2 label dropped; HEAD   -> PC (fault) / process death
  p2 wr census   -> writes stored (M_STORE); writes FAULT (M_WRFAULT) -> read-back value / PC + liveness after stores
  p2 ld widths / p2 st widths -> decline conditioned on len (M_LENFAULT) -> PC + both destination registers
  p2 ann rd / p2 ann wr (+ second passes) -> latch shared / never set / set only on reads / cleared on writes;
                    fatal->debug in either branch; (once) dropped -> line count, form, tail literal
  p2 nonword ann -> announce only for len 4 (M_ANNLEN4); 32-bit value print (M_TRUNC) -> the (len N) line / 64-bit value
  p1 fault lo / hi / wr -> return 0 -> break (M_FLTBREAK); exit(1) back (M_EXIT) -> PC 0x18, DMA0, DMT0 / process death
  p1 census      -> an extra label anywhere in 0x90..0xffc (M_ADD94) -> fault count 987 of 988
  p1 widths      -> the refusal narrowed to word accesses (M_FLTLEN, M_FLTWR) -> fault count
  p1 p2 edge     -> the last label (MISC) dropped (M_DROPMISC) / an extra label at 0x90 -> 0x8c faults / 0x90 declines
  p2 int byte / p2 int half / p3 interim -> the interim width policy changed (M_FLTLEN reds p3 interim) -> PC, DMA0
  CHECK OF THE CHANNEL LINE ITSELF (the carrier asks the first mandated applications to test it): every row above was
  named WITH its mutant before any table ran; table 1's per-row scores say whether each named channel varied.

